Description: Bump hickory to 0.26 (cherry-pick upstream PR #695)
 Upstream PR https://github.com/containers/aardvark-dns/pull/695 (merged):
 replace hickory-client with hickory-net and adapt Message/Client APIs for
 Hickory 0.26. Cargo.lock / MSRV / README bits of the PR are omitted;
 Debian already ships a newer rustc than 1.88.
Author: Paul Holzinger <pholzing@redhat.com>
